 ets-1984975333657\n\nHosted by Beyond Extraction
  (https://www.beyondextraction.ca)\n\nMine-o-Polis is an alternative board
  game created by Beyond Extraction that invites players to explore Toronto
  as a global capital of mining finance and extractive power. Be among the
  first to play-test this game and come chat with activists and researchers
  imagining how games can help make extractive politics visible and
  facilitate resistance resisted through the power of play.
END:VEVENT
